name: ['Balance', 'Berserk', 'Channel', 'Gifts Ungiven', 'Goblin Lackey', 'Kird Ape', 'Lotus Petal', 'Mystical Tutor', 'Necropotence', "Sensei's Divining Top", 'Serendib Efreet', 'Skullclamp', 'Strip Mine', 'Tinker', 'Trinisphere']
