text: ['As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact.\\nSearch your library for an artifact card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'As long as Trinisphere is untapped, each spell that would cost less than three mana to cast costs three mana to cast. (Additional mana in the cost may be paid with any color of mana or colorless mana. For example, a spell that would cost {1}{B} to cast costs {2}{B} to cast instead.)', 'Cast this spell only before the combat damage step.\\nTarget creature gains trample and gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is its power. At the beginning of the next end step, destroy that creature if it attacked this turn.', 'Each player chooses a number of lands they control equal to the number of lands controlled by the player who controls the fewest, then sacrifices the rest. Players discard cards and sacrifice creatures the same way.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/-1.\\nWhenever equipped creature dies, draw two cards.\\nEquip {1}', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, Serendib Efreet deals 1 damage to you.', 'Kird Ape gets +1/+2 as long as you control a Forest.', 'Search your library for an instant or sorcery card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'Search your library for up to four cards with different names and reveal them. Target opponent chooses two of those cards. Put the chosen cards into your graveyard and the rest into your hand. Then shuffle.', 'Skip your draw step.\\nWhenever you discard a card, exile that card from your graveyard.\\nPay 1 life: Exile the top card of your library face down. Put that card into your hand at the beginning of your next end step.', 'Until end of turn, any time you could activate a mana ability, you may pay 1 life. If you do, add {C}.', 'Whenever Goblin Lackey deals damage to a player, you may put a Goblin permanent card from your hand onto the battlefield.', "{1}: Look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order.\\n{T}: Draw a card, then put Sensei's Divining Top on top of its owner's library.", '{T}, Sacrifice Lotus Petal: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Strip Mine: Destroy target land.']
flavor: ['"Hard to imagine," mused Hanna, stroking the petal, "such a lovely flower inspiring such greed."', '"What separates us from mere beasts is the capacity for self-improvement."', 'Apes can be gentle, contemplative beasts—but context is everything.', 'At the first sign of enemy scouts, Jula grinned and strapped on his diplomacy helmet.', 'Designed to restrain petty thoughts, but used to repress entire empires.', 'Summoners of efreeti remember only the power of command, never the sting of regret.', 'The mind is a beautiful bounty encased in an annoying bone container.', 'The student searches the world for meaning. The master finds worlds of meaning in the search.', 'To some mages, the meaning of life is less important than how much is left.', 'Unlike previous conflicts, the war between Urza and Mishra made Dominaria itself a casualty of war.']
